#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:5 9f57dd517a8b4ada966627d365e9546b
msgid "QLOITER Mode"
msgstr "QLOITER 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:7 8387d84cd7374bd6935c10ada24ca625
msgid ""
"QLOITER Mode automatically attempts to maintain the current location, "
"heading and altitude. The pilot may fly the QuadPlane in QLOITER mode as if "
"it were in a more manual flight mode but when the sticks are released, the "
"vehicle will slow to a stop and hold position."
msgstr ""
"QLOITER 模式会自动尝试保持当前位置、航向和高度。飞手可以在 QLOITER 模式下像在更手动的飞行模式中一样飞行 "
"QuadPlane，但当摇杆松开后，飞行器会减速停止并保持位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:9 75de79bd1d06452aa204dc8fc4ecf780
msgid ""
"A good GPS lock, :ref:`low magnetic interference on the compass <common-"
"diagnosing-problems-using-logs_compass_interference>` and :ref:`low "
"vibrations <common-diagnosing-problems-using-logs_vibrations>` are all "
"important in achieving good QLOITER performance."
msgstr ""
"良好的 GPS 锁定、:ref:`罗盘低磁干扰 <common-diagnosing-problems-using-"
"logs_compass_interference>` 以及 :ref:`低震动 <common-diagnosing-problems-using-"
"logs_vibrations>` 对于实现良好的 QLOITER 性能均至关重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:16 441f8cb8084f4a11809ab40a7bdbfb12
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "控制"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:18 cea7eff26a1a46f3bc19dccebd1c51d7
msgid ""
"The pilot can control the QuadPlane's position with the control sticks."
msgstr "飞手可以通过控制摇杆调整 QuadPlane 的位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:20 4db94ab5119245d09871e5f879884d54
msgid ""
"Horizontal location can be adjusted with the Roll and Pitch control sticks "
"with the default maximum horizontal speed being 5m/s (see Tuning section "
"below on how to adjust this).  When the pilot releases the sticks the "
"QuadPlane will slow to a stop."
msgstr ""
"水平位置可通过横滚和俯仰控制摇杆调整，默认最大水平速度为5m/s（有关如何调整此值，请参阅下方调参部分）。当飞手松开摇杆后，QuadPlane "
"将减速停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:24 b55c4799be314159a2e543368f4e767e
msgid ""
"Altitude can be controlled with the Throttle control stick just as in "
":ref:`QHOVER<qhover-mode>` mode."
msgstr "高度可通过油门控制摇杆进行控制，方式与 :ref:`QHOVER<qhover-mode>` 模式相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:26 5cfebdc155d344f1ad26b94c94dd96ed
msgid "The heading can be set with the Yaw control stick"
msgstr "航向可通过偏航控制摇杆设定。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:28 6e3c0d1761484ad09bc28243a28b3530
msgid ""
"The vehicle can be armed in QLOITER mode in the same manner as any other "
"mode, but only once the GPS has 3D lock, and the HDOP has dropped below 2.0,"
" just as with any other mode, unless the default arming checks have been "
"modified to avoid checking GPS (not recommended!).  :ref:`More details on "
"LED patterns here <common-leds-pixhawk>`."
msgstr ""
"飞行器可以在 QLOITER 模式中以与其他模式相同的方式解锁，但前提是 GPS 已获得3D锁定，且 HDOP "
"已降至2.0以下，除非默认解锁检查已被修改为跳过 GPS 检查（不建议！）。:ref:`更多 LED 状态说明请参见此处 <common-leds-"
"pixhawk>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:32 f595b6a194e54004994be846b3f459b0
msgid "Tuning"
msgstr "调参"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:34 510d836c27464da0862d85cb0e3479b6
msgid ""
"QLOITER mode incorporates the altitude controller from QHOVER mode. Details "
"for tuning are in :ref:`QHOVER <qhover-mode>` mode description."
msgstr ""
"QLOITER 模式集成了 QHOVER 模式的高度控制器。调参详情请参阅 :ref:`QHOVER <qhover-mode>` 模式说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:37 66ae5f0d0a8b4e04b228e3b9127c0302
#, fuzzy
msgid ":ref:`Q_LOIT_SPEED_MS<Q_LOIT_SPEED_MS>`: max horizontal speed in m/s."
msgstr ":ref:`Q_LOIT_SPEED <Q_LOIT_SPEED>`：最大水平速度，单位 cm/s（例如 1250 = 12.5m/s）"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:38 222be9392b4e44b1a1db5755061d7a5f
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_LOIT_ACC_MAX_M<Q_LOIT_ACC_MAX_M>`: max acceleration in m/s/s.  "
"Higher values cause the QuadPlane to accelerate and stop more quickly"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_LOIT_ACC_MAX <Q_LOIT_ACC_MAX>`：最大加速度，单位 cm/s/s。值越高，QuadPlane "
"加速和停止越快。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:39 20dfff9adf56432cb04b8d1b5b998205
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_LOIT_ANG_MAX <Q_LOIT_ANG_MAX>`: max lean angle in centi-degrees "
"(i.e. 3000 = 30deg).  By default this value is zero which causes the "
":ref:`ATC_ANGLE_MAX<ATC_ANGLE_MAX>` parameter's value to be used"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_LOIT_ANG_MAX <Q_LOIT_ANG_MAX>`：最大倾斜角，单位厘度（例如 3000 = 30度）。默认值为零，此时将使用"
" :ref:`ANGLE_MAX <ANGLE_MAX>` 参数的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:40 95b3ac615b2f453e8346a8027c32bc22
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_LOIT_BRK_ACC_M<Q_LOIT_BRK_ACC_M>`: max acceleration in m/s/s while "
"braking (i.e. pilot has moved sticks to center).  Higher values will stop "
"the vehicle more quickly"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_LOIT_BRK_ACCEL <Q_LOIT_BRK_ACCEL>`：制动时的最大加速度，单位 "
"cm/s/s（即飞手已将摇杆移至中位）。值越高，飞行器停止越快。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:41 6d841f9c12d8465982cff7dfd26802ce
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_LOIT_BRK_DELAY <Q_LOIT_BRK_DELAY>`: the delay in seconds before "
"braking starts once the pilot has centered the sticks"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_LOIT_BRK_DELAY <Q_LOIT_BRK_DELAY>`：飞手将摇杆居中后，制动开始前的延迟时间（秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:42 04ee3bd72fc34f338b5d1687a645e605
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_LOIT_BRK_JRK_M<Q_LOIT_BRK_JRK_M>`: max change in acceleration in "
"m/s/s/s while braking.  Higher numbers will make the vehicle reach the "
"maximum braking angle more quickly, lower numbers will cause smoother "
"braking"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_LOIT_BRK_JERK <Q_LOIT_BRK_JERK>`：制动时加速度的最大变化率，单位 "
"cm/s/s/s。值越高，飞行器越快达到最大制动角；值越低，制动越平滑。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:43 2598de970f064d9bb0e8d2d8fe630cc3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_P_NE_POS_P <Q_P_NE_POS_P>`: converts the horizontal position error "
"(i.e difference between the desired position and the actual position) to a "
"desired speed towards the target position.  **It is generally not required "
"to adjust this**"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_P_POSXY_P "
"<Q_P_POSXY_P>`：将水平位置误差（即期望位置与实际位置之差）转换为朝向目标位置的期望速度。**通常无需调整此参数。**"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:44 5fedb40378fa4bb38ebee755d6c923c1
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_P_NE_VEL_P<Q_P_NE_VEL_P>`  converts the desired speed towards the "
"target to a desired acceleration.  The resulting desired acceleration "
"becomes a lean angle which is then passed to the same angular controller "
"used by :ref:`QSTABILIZE <qstabilize-mode>`.  **It is generally not required"
" to adjust this**"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_P_VELXY_P <Q_P_VELXY_P>` 将朝向目标的期望速度转换为期望加速度。所得期望加速度转换为倾斜角，再传递给与 "
":ref:`QSTABILIZE <qstabilize-mode>` 相同的角度控制器。**通常无需调整此参数。**"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:48 5c06f42faa714a74b61f957d7d757318
msgid "Common Problems"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:50 483d0b0009bb4433a6aa52d19776a939
msgid ""
"The vehicle `circles (aka \"toiletbowls\") "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a-3G9ZvXHhk>`__.  This is normally caused "
"by a compass problem the most likely being :ref:`magnetic interference "
"<common-diagnosing-problems-using-logs_compass_interference>` from the power"
" cables under the autopilot. Other possibilities include bad compass offsets"
" set during the :ref:`live calibration process <common-compass-calibration-"
"in-mission-planner>` or incorrect compass orientation."
msgstr ""
"飞行器出现 `转圈（又称「马桶效应」） "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a-3G9ZvXHhk>`__。这通常由罗盘问题引起，最可能的原因是飞控下方电源线的 "
":ref:`磁干扰 <common-diagnosing-problems-using-"
"logs_compass_interference>`。其他可能原因包括在 :ref:`实时校准过程 <common-compass-"
"calibration-in-mission-planner>` 中设置了错误的罗盘偏移量，或罗盘方向不正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:55 b09c23d4d4cd483b8bb353ad04293536
msgid ""
"The vehicle takes off in the wrong direction as soon as QLOITER is engaged."
"  The cause is the same as #1 except that the compass error is greater than "
"90deg.  Please try the suggestions above to resolve this."
msgstr "进入 QLOITER 模式后，飞行器立即朝错误方向起飞。原因与第1点相同，但罗盘误差超过90度。请尝试上述建议来解决此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:56 ad517a854ec441069ac783278324925d
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The vehicle is QLOITERing normally and then suddenly takes off in the wrong "
"direction.  This is generally caused by a :ref:`GPS Glitch <gps-failsafe-"
"glitch-protection>`. There is no 100% reliable protection against these "
"which means the pilot should always be ready to take-over manual control.  "
"Beyond that ensuring a good GPS HDOP before take-off is always good and it "
"may help to reduce the ``EK2_GLITCH_RAD`` and/or ``EK3_GLITCH_RAD`` "
"parameters (see :ref:`GPS glitch wiki page <gps-failsafe-glitch-protection>`"
" for details) to tighten up on the glitch detection."
msgstr ""
"飞行器正常 QLOITER 中突然朝错误方向飞去。这通常由 :ref:`GPS 漂移 <gps-failsafe-glitch-protection>`"
" 引起。没有100%可靠的防护措施，因此飞手应始终做好手动接管的准备。此外，起飞前确保良好的 GPS HDOP 值，以及适当减小 "
"``EK2_GLITCH_RAD`` 和/或 ``EK3_GLITCH_RAD`` 参数（详见 :ref:`GPS 漂移 wiki 页面 <gps-"
"failsafe-glitch-protection>`），可收紧漂移检测。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:64 bfe2b36bf1c84c7eb17cc26c134f7361
msgid ""
"QuadPlane slowly descends or climbs until the pilot retakes control in "
"stabilize.  Normally this is caused by not having the throttle stick in the "
"mid position.  This commonly happens when the pilot is switching into an "
"altitude holding mode from a manual flight mode (like QSTABILIZE) on a "
"QuadPlane that does not hover at mid throttle. Usually it is desired to "
"hover in any mode at mid-stick on throttle, so that transitions between "
"modes is easily accomplished without throttle position changes. This can be "
"adjusted using the :ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER<Q_M_THST_HOVER>` parameter, or "
"automatically learned in QHOVER or QLOITER modes by enabling "
":ref:`Q_M_HOVER_LEARN<Q_M_HOVER_LEARN>`."
msgstr ""
"QuadPlane 缓慢下降或上升，直到飞手在 Stabilize 模式重新接管控制。这通常是因为油门摇杆没有处于中位。当飞手从手动飞行模式（如 "
"QSTABILIZE）切换到高度保持模式时，若 QuadPlane "
"不能在中位油门悬停，就容易发生此问题。通常希望在任意模式下都能在油门中位悬停，以便模式切换时无需调整油门位置。可通过 "
":ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER<Q_M_THST_HOVER>` 参数手动调整，或通过启用 "
":ref:`Q_M_HOVER_LEARN<Q_M_HOVER_LEARN>` 在 QHOVER 或 QLOITER 模式中自动学习。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:72 4ac6551b6469488f8185a6f13ba64131
msgid "Display HDOP on Mission Planner"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 上显示 HDOP"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:73 2fb4dc396c49430880f2078a82d5c2c9
msgid ""
"The HDOP value can be made clearly visible through the mission planner's "
"Quick screen by double clicking and then selecting \"gpshdop\" from the "
"large grid of checkboxes."
msgstr "可通过在 Mission Planner 的快速屏幕上双击，然后从大型复选框网格中选择「gpshdop」来清晰显示 HDOP 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:79 0dfcb60ed6e04a25b1f5def359db9eb5
msgid "Verifying QLOITER performance with dataflash logs"
msgstr "通过 dataflash 日志验证 QLOITER 性能"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:81 841076a46d01475a97ddcbccb135ea2e
msgid ""
"Viewing the QLOITER's horizontal performance is best done by "
":ref:`downloading a dataflash log <common-downloading-and-analyzing-data-"
"logs-in-mission-planner>` from your flight, then open it with the mission "
"planner and graph the NTUN message’s DesVelX vs VelX and DesVelY vs VelY.  "
"In a good performing QuadPlane the actual velocities will track the desired "
"velocities as shown below.  X = latitude (so positive = moving North, "
"negative = South), Y = longitude (positive = East, negative = West)."
msgstr ""
"查看 QLOITER 水平性能最好的方法是：:ref:`下载飞行的 dataflash 日志 <common-downloading-and-"
"analyzing-data-logs-in-mission-planner>`，用 Mission Planner 打开后绘制 NTUN 消息中的 "
"DesVelX 与 VelX 以及 DesVelY 与 VelY 的对比图。在性能良好的 QuadPlane 中，实际速度将跟踪期望速度，如下图所示。X"
" = 纬度（正值 = 向北，负值 = 向南），Y = 经度（正值 = 向东，负值 = 向西）。"

#: ../../source/docs/qloiter-mode.rst:86 3090086fb548439880aa0509d92c39b2
msgid ""
"Checking altitude hold performance is the same as for :ref:`QHOVER <qhover-"
"mode>` mode."
msgstr "高度保持性能的检查方式与 :ref:`QHOVER <qhover-mode>` 模式相同。"
